{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_st01",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_st01",
  "title": "禾下夢",
  "storyCode": "HS-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dc75c698a6228a00154c6ea0b0c8d4aaa480aaad62e5bd447a087fb39d16c6ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哪裡能見到這樣一片農田？\n稻子瘋了似的長，齊刷刷筆挺挺地直立著，像是牧獸秋後的毛。風一吹，太陽一烤，便泛起熱騰騰的浪來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人站在田地中央，亂蓬蓬的枝葉不住拉扯著她的衣擺。她撥開莖稈，向浩瀚的金黃深處走去，像是穿越一片海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上哪去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找莊稼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不是遍地都是莊稼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要找能種到更遠的地方去的莊稼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼要到別的地方種莊稼？這裡有這麼多，還不夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些莊稼，餵不飽所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在這，找多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙沙。\n一隻鼴獸從地洞裡探出頭來，陰暗的坑洞應該連接到了很遠的地方，渺小的生物也是漂泊的外來客。\n直到它看見了這片無邊際的田野，像是被這種寬廣深深地震撼了，它悲哀地嘆了一口氣，又折回了暗無天日的地底。\n……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們怎麼知道，種子種下去會發芽？怎麼預知天氣的變化？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看得多了，自然就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看多了就能知道……包括發生在很久以後的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "種瓜得瓜，種豆得豆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莊稼是種子變的，“我們”又是什麼變的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們從哪裡來？死後又會到哪裡去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們是從大地長出來的，死了以後也會回到地裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人和莊稼，都一樣。天地萬物，都在輪迴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的童聲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像你教我的那首歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醒一醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情況怎樣？從外面看，這“大傢伙”好像還不是很聽話的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且看起來比我的幾個妹妹還要調皮一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先停一下吧，這裡又不是夕平常亂畫的那些東西，我怕你待的時間長了，腦殼犯暈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心點……心急吃不了熱豆腐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說得也是，確實有些疲憊了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……小年，可以拉我一把嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們再不出來，我就考慮自己回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是嗎？我看看，剛才是誰被嚇得小臉發白了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們現在在給“巨獸”做心臟起搏手術哎，哪有那麼容易？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟我講這個計劃的時候，我覺得你一定是瘋了……虧你敢想這種點子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是用整座移動城市模擬一隻巨獸嘛，我形你意，形神兼備，有什麼不行的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小年是越來越機靈能幹了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少來。要是沒有天師府的老傢伙和黍姐，她能成什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幫司歲台做了這麼多雜事，累積下的人情總該派上點用場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，情況到底怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但要用這個玩意作為替代本尊的容器，在那個老傢伙被幹掉以後，我們這些虛無縹緲的可憐人還能有所依憑，恐怕還得費點力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟是個麻煩的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪裡好了，還不是一事無成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不就想說，造這個玩意你也出了力。沒被姐姐稱讚，吃醋了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……幼稚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夕的畫技也精進了。雖然這麼多年沒見，看來還是有認真用功，沒有虛度光陰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還是無法想像。靠一副假的軀體“以假亂真”不是難事，但終究只是“亂”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說到底它不過是我們分出來的一小部分……三個人的力量拼湊在一起的產物，而且還不完整。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這十二樓五城，要怎麼成為我們這些人的容身之處……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，或許吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但在畫卷裡的時候，我確實感受到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“生命”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "獸與厚土行，“我們”原本也是這片大地上生長出的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……也許真的行得通呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎！聊點別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們不知道朝廷那幾個多難纏！說是把十二樓五城暫且借給我們安個“家”，實際上既要把老天師換回來，又要解決他們另一個麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是炎國人會做生意啊，直接把我們的“家”變成橋頭堡了，辦一件事，他們要得兩份好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只是沒想到，大炎竟然在技術層面又更進一步了。有完沒完，他們真的還有必要畏懼“歲”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這“家”就算建好了，也是在他們眼皮底下被看著，真不自在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，做這件事有多少風險？我自己都沒有把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛才你們在畫卷裡，有一瞬間，我想起了三姐那個時候……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小墨頭也會擔心姐姐啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小墨頭？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是以前你，把硯台打翻，剛好扣在頭上那次，令說你就是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記不得了。沒有的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊。我想起來了，後來你蹲在池子旁邊洗臉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都說了我不記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從清澈的池子裡掬起一抔清水，你洗了臉，水渾了，還能重新掬出一抔清水嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是頡這麼問的。她看起來溫婉可人，其實比誰都機靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果小年的計劃真的能成功的話，那真是最好的結果了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那當然，還有誰不想讓這件事成功呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "臭棋簍子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰知道他到底想做什麼，自從大姐的事情之後，我有時看到墨塊都會懷疑是不是他弄出來的什麼“分身”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們為了製造這個容器費了這麼多功夫，他竟然隨隨便便就能把自己分割開嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何苦呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他恨人世間種種事物，但最恨自己。可他聰明啊，那麼聰明，難道會覺得和大炎你死我活是頡想見的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰知道……這麼久以來，也就你還願意搭理他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了。提到聰明人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那一位呢？有段時間沒聽過他的消息了，他不是最黏姐姐你的，吵架了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了那個臭棋簍子，司歲台最惦記的應該就是他了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小聲）比起那個臭棋簍子，我更不願意和那個臭繡花的打交道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……他很久沒有回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是嗎？算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管他也好，我們一家能有三個聚在這裡，還是看在那些老傢伙都在這坐鎮的分上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是說“事不過三”嗎，我們天天家庭聚餐，有龍要不高興了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，時候也不早了，我先去忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們最近也辛苦了，等你們有空的時候，再到我這吃飯，我好好做幾道菜招待你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，雖然吃不到小個子的手藝，但老姐的手藝也是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看我幹嘛——呃，我剛才說錯話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你明知道他們關係很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以為那是很久以前的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪壺不開提哪壺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "家庭關係，是這麼沉重的嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幾百年一次的姐妹見面，沉重一點也算正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道嗎，比起被大哥和令姐嘮叨，我更害怕看到她剛剛那個樣子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這一點上，我倒是難得和你有共識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一臉委屈又一句話不說，想要嘮叨什麼又不忍心的樣子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這哪裡是姐姐，簡直像是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能……她只是一個人在這裡待了太久了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這是我種的果樹結的最大最圓的兩個桃子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神農保佑……能不能按時畢業，就看這一季稻穀了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經是第三個年頭了，每次都在最關鍵的節骨眼上出事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前年課題是防蟲害，臨收穫碰上大旱，莊稼全死在試驗田裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去年的課題是防乾旱，收穫前又是接連大雨……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神農保佑……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戊子號地塊今天合併到主城區，千萬不要出問題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "學生自知學藝不精，回到天師府我一定好好學習繼續深造……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在只求整個工程順順利利結束，我也可以提早回家去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸欸，看清楚，這裡供奉的是神農，你們工地上的湊什麼熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們種糧是“盡人事聽天命”，你們搞工程的也要靠天吃飯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你懂什麼，所有複雜的學問，研究到最深處都是玄學，是人力不可及的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "盡人事，聽天命，哪行哪業都是一樣——神農算這片地最早的主人了，只能指望她顯顯靈，保佑一下我們這些徒子徒孫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，說的也對。反正都是到了自己做什麼都沒用的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願心誠，能換來神農顯靈吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吵死個人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎喲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "農業天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "桃核……？哪掉下來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "房樑上？是誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睡個覺都睡不安穩，看不到有人在這裡午休嗎！你們在這裡唧唧歪歪什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "擾人清夢罪大惡極！這裡是什麼地方？神農祠是給你們磕頭求祖宗的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都滾滾滾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的天……這誰家小孩這麼沒教養——\n啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天師學徒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸——你還丟？！好痛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啊！……快走！嘿我告訴你，大人不記小人過，別讓我再——\n啊！夜路上看到你……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脾氣很差的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "孩童拿起香案上的兩顆果子，端詳了一會，挑了一個更大的，用衣袖抹了抹吃了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脾氣很差的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每次城裡碰上些大事小事，你這桌上倒是先豐收了，來你這裡肯定餓不著肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脾氣很差的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，老神農，拿你兩個果子吃，不介意吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哎呀，還是房梁睡著涼快……\n我的扇子呢，又被那個小孩拿走了？\n煩人鬼，還叫我“大嗓門”，下回得想辦法把她的笛子偷過來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脾氣很差的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上學上學，上個鳥學，天師府教出來的也不過是這群不爭氣的學生，上學還有什麼意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脾氣很差的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，逃學可真難啊……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鄉長啊……這小無人機到底出了什麼毛病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你之前換能源裝置的時候是不是忘了操作步驟，這有幾根線沒有接上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道啊，也許是被誰家小孩偷偷拿去玩“鬥羽獸”了……下次被我抓到，看我不揍他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它摔下來的時候有沒有砸到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碰到角上了，差點沒砸到腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平常見您就是和大家一起做農活，沒想到您還懂源石電路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天師給大家上課的時候不都教過怎麼用，這是個精密物件，用起來得注意點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個小東西也不叫無人機，天師管這個叫“天樁”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第一次見這玩意往田裡飛的時候，鋪天蓋地的，差點以為是蝗災，嚇一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這些小玩意，一個個地插到地裡，這地裡的情況，莊稼的長勢，就全能知道了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們在這琢磨種莊稼，天師們也在琢磨怎麼幫我們。現在有這些新發明，種田比過去方便多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這季收成……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今年天氣不如意，每塊田裡產出都不好。眼前這季試驗稻，天師們起代號叫“千鐘”的，估計著也就畝產兩千來斤吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夠吃是夠吃，離天師們預想的研究結果還差得遠吶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "慢慢來吧。一年能收兩季的莊稼，放過去，哪敢想啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處，龐大的機械托舉著一整塊田地緩緩升起，巨大的聲響驚起了一群羽獸。\n田間的農人似是已經對這樣的景象司空見慣，抬眼瞧了瞧，又專注於手上的農活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大荒城改造的工程動起來，外面進來了不少大人物，您也變成大忙人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好幾天沒見到您的人影了，今天怎麼有空來地裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "夏收就要開始了，每塊地的狀態都得自己看過才能知道，人才能安排得下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有最近操辦祭祀典禮的事，都要認真籌備，馬虎不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是大荒城管事的，從您到這裡上任，這麼多年上下多少事都得您操心，多勞累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您官職到底是叫什麼來著……大荒城，同知？哎，太拗口，還是喊您老鄉長了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼官不官的，都是和大家一起種地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我打出生就在這了，也沒去過外面。聽說外面有些移動城市裡，莊稼都是種在高樓大廈裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是從外面進來的，那外面的城市，是什麼樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那都是多少年前的事了，我也記不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只記得有些小鄉村裡的人收到信使送去的大荒城培育出的種子，笑著說今年的收成說不定能多一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……只求不遇上天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "種在地裡的種子能研究明白，頭頂這片天可研究不明白啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算天災沒有直擊田地，水源也會被源石污染，泥土裡全是細小的源石結晶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。光是能在富源石環境裡開墾的設備，就不便宜囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我們才在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，修好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "圍堤攏起這片土地上時而枯涸時而氾濫的溝壑。\n在高出地面百公尺有餘的水道之間，種植地塊執手相望。\n而這座仍在“成長”中的移動城市——\n對耕耘於此的新一代大荒人而言，這將是由他們親手開闢的新天地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這工程，也是夠嚇人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忍過這半年吧，等土地都搬到地塊上就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人倒還好，就是養的牧獸被嚇得不輕。這幾個月糧草都沒怎麼吃，看起來都瘦了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看這田一天天地升起來，總覺得還是有點心慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "田地搬到移動地塊上，好處多著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用電用水更容易了不說，再遇上大一點的天災，也不用天師們豁了命來頂，整片田開走就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這普普通通的田裡都祖祖輩輩種了多少年了，怎麼官家突然想起來要翻修我們這邊的田地了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "糧食種得好種得多，更多人吃飽肚子，才有力氣建城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡直就跟變魔術似的，出了趟遠門的人，回來怕都要不認識家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可要是神農知道，我們把這田都搬走了，她老人家該怎麼想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "土地只是變了副模樣，家又不會走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是神農真的看到眼前這幅景象，大概笑得嘴都合不攏啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最早的時候，她來到這片地方，還只是想著從天寒地凍的荒原上多搶幾畝田地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "後來田地變多了，她種田的點子也變多了，想把糧食種到源石污染的土地裡去，甚至種到源石裡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的職農",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪有這麼荒唐的事……你說這神農，到底是聰明，還是笨啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鄉長",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不聰明，也不笨。就是個癡人罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大——水——牛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "笨——水——牛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你到底陪不陪我去找“綿綿”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真沒良心！綿綿明明最喜歡你，別人餵他零食他都不好好吃的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是說它把我花圃裡養的半楓荷全都吃光的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……誰叫你自己不圍籬笆的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是為了別人用的時候採摘方便，誰能想到你會拿去餵牧獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好只是幾朵花，你忘了之前牧獸吃了老師的試驗田那次，老師是怎麼說你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（扮鬼臉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說了，牧獸身上都有定位器，已經顯示了它就在這一片，你自己再仔細找找不就行了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……也對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你陪我去果林摘點果子好了，趁它們還沒長熟，味道還是又酸又苦的，要趕緊摘一點，我有很重要的用途！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天還要去田裡採樣，夏收前的最後一次數據記錄很關鍵，不能拖延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真無聊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是說真的，最近大家看起來都不太對勁，不好好吃飯，覺都睡不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是說會跟它們講話嘛，多勸勸它們好好吃飯不就好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我跟他們聊過了，他們告訴我，大荒城最近有些很可怕的東西混進來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是說，那些新建起來的移動地塊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是不是笨，牧獸只是會跟我說話，又不是跟人一樣聰明，他們哪裡知道是什麼東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不是很聰明，我只知道現在田地裡的工作最重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼不能偷偷懶，把工作派給那個新來的人？反正就是把田裡的天樁挨個抽出來記數字的事，誰做不都一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他懂什麼……他剛來的時候連小麥和高粱都分不清楚，他做完的事情我還要再做一遍，不知道老師為什麼會讓我來教他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是他跑得快，說不定能幫我找到綿綿——\n對了，我去找他幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什……？他……老師叫他過來就是專門來耕地的，他不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "質樸的少年",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳……還是我陪你去吧，等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頑皮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——新來的——！別瞎忙了，來幫我找牧獸吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夏天陽光熱烈，陣陣蟬鳴。水田裡，少年笨拙地收割著水稻，豆大的汗珠不斷從臉上滾落。\n手臂肌肉結實，卻不知如何使力，鐮刀對纖細的稻稈像是無可奈何，好半天才能割下一把稻子。\n原本穿在身上的官服掛在一旁的樁柱上，幾隻想來啄食稻穀的羽獸反而對這身從未見過的衣服產生了興趣，衝著飄落的衣帶伸出嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼已經中午了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有這麼多啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
